{"productId": "d4e56ece-abc1-4418-baeb-7348f195d7a6", "modelName": "X-Bolt 2 Speed Dark Maple", "modelDescription": "X-Bolt Speed rifles have been at the top of the hunting rifle mountain for several years. Not only did the Speed rifle break new ground with its straight-shooting features, it was also cosmetically different than other bolt-action rifles with a barreled action protected by a durable Cerakote finish, camouflage on the lightweight composite stock, and a fluted, sporter weight precision barrel. The awesome appearance of the Speed rifle was more than ably backed-up by its tack driving performance. This new model veers off the trail from other Speed rifles, replacing the composite camo stock with a stabilized AAA dark maple stock. This stock is stiff, trim, and engineered to resist the effects of heat and moisture better than a standard wood stock. The satin finish limits glare and ensures that this Speed rifle stays true to the hunting pedigree of the original. Checkering at the grip and fore-end offers all-conditions grip. Low profile bottom metal further enhances the appearance of this wooden workhorse.", "manufacturerName": "Browning", "subProducts": [{"isFirearm": true, "isNfa": false, "subProductId": "0118827f-519c-48df-bf99-b7e91530110c", "description": "Browning, X-Bolt 2 Speed Dark Maple, Bolt Action, 6.5 Creedmoor, 22\" Threaded Barrel, Muzzle Brake, Tungsten Cerakote Finish, AAA Dark Walnut Stock, Right Hand, 4 Round Capacity", "imageUrls": ["https://main-images.gearfire.com/SubProductImages/b0456f82-14fa-487a-a19f-f8cd344fe597"], "isDefault": false, "manufacturerPartNumber": "036067282", "upc": "023614863434", "attributes": [{"attributeNameId": "5d7cb225-7607-4efe-ad2f-d56197e694de", "attributeName": "Adjustable Stock", "attributeValueId": "f3810c6c-d0fc-424a-81ad-cfaf1f11ff2f", "valueName": "No"}, {"attributeNameId": "dc7a7e89-2701-44c0-a795-288bc55143bb", "attributeName": "Barrel Length", "attributeValueId": "21a0479f-f302-434a-9087-61aca6aff